{"id":"663949","name":"口蘑干煎鸡","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663949/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"口蘑","amount":"适量"},{"name":"欧芹碎","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿正骨洗净。","img":"images/663949/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"改刀切小块。","img":"images/663949/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡腿肉沥干水份放入盆中。","img":"images/663949/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉，生抽，蚝油，老抽抓拌均匀。","img":"images/663949/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量花生油抓匀腌制半小时左右。","img":"images/663949/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"口蘑洗净改刀切小块。","img":"images/663949/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡腿肉。","img":"images/663949/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将鸡肉均匀摊开。","img":"images/663949/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煎至金黄后盛出。","img":"images/663949/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中放入黄油。","img":"images/663949/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入口蘑。","img":"images/663949/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煎炒出汁。","img":"images/663949/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入煎过的鸡腿肉。","img":"images/663949/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煎炒均匀，少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/663949/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘后洒上少量欧芹碎。","img":"images/663949/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663949/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663949/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}